---
layout: layouts/picker.njk
title: Choose your website style | Caitlin's style studio
description: Pick the website looks and bright colors you love for Caitlin's portfolio.
---
<div class="picker-shell" data-style-picker>
  <section class="picker-intro" id="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
    <p class="picker-eyebrow">Made for Caitlin</p>
    <h1 id="intro-title">Let's find a look that feels like <em>you.</em></h1>
    <p>Swipe through a few website styles and bright color palettes. Pass on what feels wrong, like what feels good, and love your favorites. It takes about two minutes.</p>
    <div class="intro-sample" aria-hidden="true"><span>bold</span><span>bright</span><span>all yours</span></div>
    <button class="primary-button" type="button" data-start>Start choosing</button>
  </section>

  <section class="picker-game" id="game" aria-labelledby="game-title" hidden>
    <div class="game-topline"><span id="stage-label">Website styles</span><span id="progress-label">1 of 12</span></div>
    <div class="progress-track" aria-hidden="true"><span id="progress-fill"></span></div>
    <h2 id="game-title">Which website look feels right?</h2>
    <p class="game-instruction" id="game-instruction">Imagine your own photos and work in each layout. Choose the overall feel.</p>
    <div class="card-stage" id="card-stage" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div class="choice-controls" aria-label="Rate this option">
      <button class="choice-button choice-button--pass" type="button" data-rate="0"><span aria-hidden="true">×</span>Pass</button>
      <button class="choice-button choice-button--like" type="button" data-rate="1"><span aria-hidden="true">♥</span>Like</button>
      <button class="choice-button choice-button--love" type="button" data-rate="2"><span aria-hidden="true">★</span>Love</button>
    </div>
    <div class="game-footer"><button class="quiet-button" type="button" data-undo>Undo last pick</button><span>Swipe left to pass or right to like</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="picker-results" id="results" aria-labelledby="results-title" hidden>
    <p class="picker-eyebrow">Your taste, captured</p>
    <h2 id="results-title" tabindex="-1">Here's what you picked.</h2>
    <p>Review your favorites, then send them through so we can shape your portfolio around them.</p>
    <div class="results-columns"><div><h3>Website looks</h3><ul id="style-results"></ul></div><div><h3>Color palettes</h3><ul id="palette-results"></ul></div></div>
    <form id="results-form" method="POST" action="https://formspree.io/f/mjgaeykk">
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" hidden />
      <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Caitlin website style picks" />
      <input type="hidden" name="source" value="caitlinbritten.com/style-picker" />
      <input type="hidden" name="style_loves" id="style-loves" />
      <input type="hidden" name="style_likes" id="style-likes" />
      <input type="hidden" name="palette_loves" id="palette-loves" />
      <input type="hidden" name="palette_likes" id="palette-likes" />
      <input type="hidden" name="all_ratings" id="all-ratings" />
      <label for="picker-name">Your name</label>
      <input id="picker-name" name="name" type="text" value="Caitlin" maxlength="100" required />
      <label for="picker-note">Anything else we should know? <span>(optional)</span></label>
      <textarea id="picker-note" name="note" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="I love bold pink, but not too much yellow..."></textarea>
      <div class="results-actions"><button class="primary-button" type="submit">Send my picks</button><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-copy>Copy summary</button></div>
      <p class="form-note">Your picks go to the same inbox as this site's contact form. You can also copy the summary for yourself.</p>
    </form>
    <button class="quiet-button" type="button" data-restart>Start over</button>
  </section>
  <noscript><p class="noscript-note">Please enable JavaScript to use the style picker.</p></noscript>
</div>
